{
  "note": "The blocking-function JWT payload, pinned on both sides: console/src/functions/blocking.ts (blockingPayload) and the Auth emulator's generate_blocking_jwt (crates/auth-front/src/blocking.rs). Each case gives the call (target, event, the account in Auth REST shape, the sign-in method, and the fixed time and id) and the payload both must write, field for field.",
  "cases": [
